TI  - Reactions between basalt and CO2-rich seawater at 250 and 350 °C, 500 bars: Implications for the CO2 sequestration into the modern oceanic crust and the composition of hydrothermal vent fluid in the CO2-rich early ocean
T2  - CHEMICAL GEOLOGY
LA  - English
