TI  - The representation of alkalinity and the carbonate pump from CMIP5 to CMIP6 Earth system models and implications for the carbon cycle
T2  - BIOGEOSCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - ARTIFICIAL OCEAN ALKALINIZATION
KW  - CALCITE DISSOLUTION KINETICS
KW  - BIOGEOCHEMICAL MODEL
KW  - CIRCULATION MODEL
KW  - ATMOSPHERIC CO2
KW  - DIOXIDE REMOVAL
KW  - ORGANIC-CARBON
KW  - CLIMATE-CHANGE
