TI  - Temporal shifts in prokaryotic metabolism in response to organic carbon dynamics in the mesopelagic ocean during an export event in the Southern ocean
T2  - DEEP-SEA RESEARCH PART II-TOPICAL STUDIES IN OCEANOGRAPHY
LA  - English
KW  - Energy limitation
KW  - Carbon limitation
KW  - Prokaryotic metabolism
