TI  - Soil Cycles of Elements simulator for Predicting TERrestrial regulation of greenhouse gases: SCEPTER v0.9
T2  - GEOSCIENTIFIC MODEL DEVELOPMENT
LA  - English
KW  - AUTOMATON BIOTURBATION SIMULATOR
KW  - REACTIVE TRANSPORT MODEL
KW  - EARTH SYSTEM MODELS
