TI  - The coastal Critical Zone sciences: an emerging research area
T2  - CHINESE SCIENCE BULLETIN-CHINESE
LA  - Chinese
KW  - coastal Earth Critical Zone
KW  - critical zone structure-process coupling
KW  - ecological functions
KW  - sustainable development and management
