TI  - Evidence against dust-mediated control of glacial-interglacial changes in atmospheric CO2
T2  - NATURE
LA  - English
KW  - EQUATORIAL PACIFIC-OCEAN
KW  - SOUTHERN-OCEAN
KW  - EXPORT PRODUCTION
