TI  - Geological CO2 sequestration in multi-compartment reservoirs: Geomechanical challenges
T2  - JOURNAL OF GEOPHYSICAL RESEARCH-SOLID EARTH
LA  - English
KW  - DEEP SALINE AQUIFERS
KW  - LAND SUBSIDENCE
KW  - FLUID-FLOW
