TI  - Assessment framework to predict sensitivity of marine calcifiers to ocean alkalinity enhancement - identification of biological thresholds and importance of precautionary principle
T2  - BIOGEOSCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - CARCINUS-MAENAS
KW  - CARBON-DIOXIDE
KW  - SHORE CRAB
KW  - SEA-WATER
