TI  - Simulating atmospheric CO2, 13C and the marine carbon cycle during the Last Glacial-Interglacial cycle: possible role for a deepening of the mean remineralization depth and an increase in the oceanic nutrient inventory
T2  - QUATERNARY SCIENCE REVIEWS
