TI  - Enhanced weathering strategies for stabilizing climate and averting ocean acidification
T2  - NATURE CLIMATE CHANGE
LA  - English
KW  - CARBON-DIOXIDE
KW  - FUTURE CLIMATE
KW  - MODEL
KW  - CYCLE
KW  - TIME
