TI  - Soil management practices can contribute to net carbon neutrality in California
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH LETTERS
LA  - English
KW  - emissions reduction
KW  - land use
KW  - soil carbon
KW  - inorganic carbon
KW  - enhanced weathering
KW  - CALAND
KW  - climate change mitigation
KW  - CLIMATE
