TI  - Crab-Inspired Ion Capture in an Organic Electrode for High-Capacity Electrochemical Desalination With Minimal Carbon Footprint
T2  - ADVANCED FUNCTIONAL MATERIALS
LA  - English
KW  - capacitive deionization
KW  - carbon footprint
KW  - electrochemical approach
KW  - organic electrode
KW  - sustainable desalination
KW  - WATER
KW  - AROMATICITY
