TI  - Detection and monitoring of leaked CO2 through sediment, water column and atmosphere in a sub-seabed CCS experiment
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF GREENHOUSE GAS CONTROL
LA  - English
KW  - QICS
KW  - Sub-seabed carbon capture and storage (CCS)
KW  - In situ pH/pCO(2) sensor
KW  - CO2 leakage
KW  - Detection and monitoring
